        "filing_date": "2025-10-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By engaging with our customers early in the product life-cycle to identify and design features and performance characteristics into our products, we are able to manufacture products that anticipate and address our customers’ changing needs.",
        "start_character": 19660,
        "end_character": 19900
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000723125-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000723125-25-000028-7deb81957a1fa7ec",
        "accession_number": "0000723125-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In recent years, we have produced an increasingly broad portfolio of products and system solutions, which enhances our ability to allocate resources to our most profitable products but also increases the complexity of our manufacturing and supply chain operations.",
        "start_character": 28561,
        "end_character": 28825
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000723125-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000723125-25-000028-7deb81957a1fa7ec",
        "accession_number": "0000723125-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To compete in the semiconductor memory and storage markets, we must continue to develop technologically advanced products and processes.",
        "start_character": 39570,
        "end_character": 39706
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000723125-25-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000723125-25-000028-7deb81957a1fa7ec",
        "accession_number": "0000723125-25-000028",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To remain competitive, we must continuously develop and implement new products and technologies and decrease manufacturing costs in spite of inflationary pressures, changing technologies, rapid market changes, and regulatory uncertainty.",
