        "filing_date": "2025-10-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manufacture our products within our own facilities located in Taiwan, Singapore, Japan, the United States, Malaysia, China, and India and also utilize subcontractors to perform certain manufacturing processes.",
